[{"title":"黄蜀葵","author":"徐渭","text":"自叹南冠奏曲时，不如画里向阳枝。\n赭衣一著从摇落，总有丹心托向谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40181,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至东天目之第四亭观瀑布","author":"徐渭","text":"渴后遥观瀑布飞，游人烟火绕青藜。\n赤龙一揽华池水，不觉莲抽十丈泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40182,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"倪某别有三绝见遗 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"世事茫茫射覆然，都从黑地料青天。\n汝南月旦君如准，好握山中宰相权。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40183,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"倪某别有三绝见遗 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"宿世拖逋且一圈，今生杀虎为牛缘。\n傍人不信无边被，不在吾家被里眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40184,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"倪某别有三绝见遗 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"桃李成溪不待言，鸟言人昧枉啾喧。\n要知猿叫肠堪断，除是侬身自做猿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40185,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"右军修禊图二鹅浴于溪","author":"徐渭","text":"兰亭修禊只须臾，也抱双鹅洛浅渠。\n校计吾侪淹酒肉，教鹅不啄一虾鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40186,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"范蠡载西施之五湖图","author":"徐渭","text":"五湖一舸载谁摇，尽道西施伴蠡逃。\n老案一翻千古后，成都太史是皋陶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40187,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东山赌墅图有双鬟侍侧","author":"徐渭","text":"闻道东山赌墅年，胭红粉白两婵娟。\n主人出画催题急，愁擦金钗打翠钿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40188,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"剪子岭","author":"徐渭","text":"剪子高崖五树松，横拖铁板夹西东。\n中间一线通人马，远处看来密似缝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40189,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孟冬下旬樱桃作花折寄守经并小作二首希和而海棠一枝白醑一壶及妙咏一绝巳先在门矣余既和其绝复拟此律方入哦见囱梅复花王山人至问其园云无不花也果尔岂能逐品为赋咏耶因统以一律而昨夕风恶甚邻竹纷折划如岁爆庾江潭云树犹如此人何以堪噫伤哉　附次来倡海棠白醑诗","author":"徐渭","text":"半年不复作鲸吞，白饮无红搅不红。\n今日不愁人不醉，太真新出浴汤温。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40190,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钓图","author":"徐渭","text":"罨画松高惹白云，一丝藿叶乱纷纷。\n不知更有任公子，半饵椎牛五十觔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40191,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过沈明石宅","author":"徐渭","text":"城南湖水接三山，片棹相过雪未残。\n看了图书三百卷，暮鸦数点落溪湾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40192,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送某上虞","author":"徐渭","text":"别处一江梅蕊纤，行从万里粤山尖。\n已知作尉盘无肉，何必参军颊有髯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40193,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题雪压梅竹图","author":"徐渭","text":"云间老桧与天齐，腾六寒威一手提。\n折竹折梅因底事，不留一叶与山溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40194,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陟圯遐思册","author":"徐渭","text":"孝子行游江水浔，千年陟圯与同情。\n一航正泛输公棹，百里难酬负米心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40195,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"老子骑牛度关图","author":"徐渭","text":"化人西来化穆满，渠又西行化恁人。\n枉杀周廷闲柱史，肯如汉女嫁乌孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40196,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"掏耳图","author":"徐渭","text":"做哑妆聋苦未能，关心都犯痒和疼。\n仙人何用闲掏耳，事事人间不耐听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40197,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马舜举放鹇留鹿郭清狂饲雉引猿二图联卷","author":"徐渭","text":"喂雉看猿挂白云，放鹇留鹿立斜矄。\n同群鸟兽何不可，七十二番于国君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40198,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天河","author":"徐渭","text":"天河下看匡瀑垂，桑蛾蚕口一丝飞。\n昨宵杀虱三十个，亦报将军破月支。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40199,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观碑","author":"徐渭","text":"曹瞒元不到东关，立马扪碑本稗官。\n只好漫供图画手，若修正史即须删。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40200,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奕樵立观","author":"徐渭","text":"朅来诗思何低迷，欲向邻家稍乞醯。\n世间甲子须臾事，逢著仙人莫看棋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40201,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马坐营索咏","author":"徐渭","text":"五对牙旗十马排，军中争羡坐营回。\n侬今富贵何由得，解背胡庭入汉来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40202,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏降龙画一首","author":"徐渭","text":"首下居高来自东，不偕箕帚独飞雄。\n物情自古浑宜假，莫向人间恼叶公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40203,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石壁观音","author":"徐渭","text":"结趺一似嵌金山，霎向金沙卖鲤还。\n总付裱工牢著糨，有时跳下在人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40204,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钮给事中花园藏陈山人所画水仙花次王子韵一首而陈文学示我五首故我亦如数 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"西子当年浣苧罗，山樊阿姊亦凌波。\n一丛挂向黄门壁，二美容颜若个过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40205,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钮给事中花园藏陈山人所画水仙花次王子韵一首而陈文学示我五首故我亦如数 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"秦楼有女身姓罗，使君立马待回波。\n正侣水仙初放雪，二十未足十五过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40206,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钮给事中花园藏陈山人所画水仙花次王子韵一首而陈文学示我五首故我亦如数 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"年年花药縳红罗，给谏池塘影赤波。\n争似黄冠簪玉导，色虽不及丰神过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40207,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钮给事中花园藏陈山人所画水仙花次王子韵一首而陈文学示我五首故我亦如数 其四","author":"徐渭","text":"弓鞋窄窄寸来罗，踏水乘鱼浅浅波。\n谁把江蛾勾入画，夫人自嫁不吾过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40208,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钮给事中花园藏陈山人所画水仙花次王子韵一首而陈文学示我五首故我亦如数 其五","author":"徐渭","text":"海樵笔能移汨罗，分明纸上皱鳞波。\n况添一种梅花妹，比较离骚香更过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40209,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大兄八十初度为重丸后二日直是年以医劳得冠带而楼居南对火珠山","author":"徐渭","text":"壶公壶对火珠山，寿酒年年菊正团。\n近得鲍姑南海艾，火珠山作水晶丸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40210,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梨花白燕赠医者","author":"徐渭","text":"斑虎杏林神护春，白燕梨花画亦神。\n莫嫌画燕只供眼，有日双双语向人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40211,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画壁观音像","author":"徐渭","text":"金身十丈不可问，碧山一带相与还。\n夜来狮子吼一吼，试问百兽寒不寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40212,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张东谷索题王仲山所画小蛙鱼荷芦叶图","author":"徐渭","text":"荷钱小小芦垂垂，鸣蛙独坐歇鼓吹。\n问渠何事喑如此，留待黄鹤孔稚圭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40213,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹤轩刘法师号也索诗","author":"徐渭","text":"露浥风翻水殿淇，金钟玉磬夜深时。\n谁能来往云霄上，只许刘郎只鹤骑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40214,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈玉屏饷瓦窑村银鱼","author":"徐渭","text":"银鱼百尾瓦窑肥，蛤蜊缄唇径寸围。\n若更墙头过一斗，杨州鹤亦不须骑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40215,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹泉篇二首为铁笔王子 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"竹下流泉枕上听，琅玕细绕玉琤琤。\n都猜尔祖仍骑鹤，夜夜来吹月下笙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40216,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹泉篇二首为铁笔王子 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"籀也长愁宿墨栖，相将洗砚凿鹅池。\n今添竹坞新生水，尽荡松烟旧死螭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40217,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿星画","author":"徐渭","text":"乌巾高插拂云轻，仅压长头碧眼睛。\n昨夜老人尾不见，偶然落在世间行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40218,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题余医师南桥卷","author":"徐渭","text":"董奉门前朝暮霞，无时不是杏开花。\n桥南人渡迷桥北，问道花开第几家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40219,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯歌一首赠参将戚公","author":"徐渭","text":"破贼书来鸟共飞，江东谢傅喜生眉。\n即招记室横彤管，共泛楼船倒玉卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40220,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中豋斋云岩遥忆王仲房","author":"徐渭","text":"雪下齐云风转斜，山形俱作白莲花。\n安道新来自剡水，千峰那认子猷家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40221,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨雪和韵奉酬季长史公 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"夜来飞雪正茫茫，早起窥帘一径藏。\n穷巷从来人迹少，却疑高士卧成僵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40222,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨雪和韵奉酬季长史公 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"高城流水去茫茫，逻卒登陴带雪藏。\n夜半忽闻同伴语，何如春茧野蚕僵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40223,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨雪和韵奉酬季长史公 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"凭高四顾入茫茫，目惨云昏百物藏。\n何处取将春意看，小园数寸笋芽僵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40224,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨雪和韵奉酬季长史公 其四","author":"徐渭","text":"雷吞虫蛰两微茫，杀气司冬合闭藏。\n六花莫道寒难犯，百足由来死不僵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40225,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨雪和韵奉酬季长史公 其五","author":"徐渭","text":"回风搅霰坠茫茫，花片偏宜树底藏。\n剡水空长人不在，瑶琴未弄指先僵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40226,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨雪和韵奉酬季长史公 其六","author":"徐渭","text":"东郭先生事渺茫，人传敝履雪中藏。\n自嫌絮袜深何限，未踏琼铺尽日僵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40227,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨雪和韵奉酬季长史公 其七","author":"徐渭","text":"趁雪探梅入杳茫，深山端合有龙藏。\n莫教一夜深千尺，却与蛇虫共穴僵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40228,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨雪和韵奉酬季长史公 其八","author":"徐渭","text":"南北相望两混茫，北胡犹耐雪中藏。\n定知昨夜窥宣府，鹿革靴连马镫僵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40229,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送马先生赴安福谕","author":"徐渭","text":"曾从讲席抱琴弹，自絷南冠隔往还。\n见说近承安福檄，将乘风雪过常山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40230,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为郑先生题画四首值大醉 其一 网鱼图群雁迅飞","author":"徐渭","text":"撒网打鱼惊雁飞，钓竿閒挂冷鱼矶。\n醉馀正好割鲜脍，怪杀松鲈画里肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40231,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为郑先生题画四首值大醉 其二 樵","author":"徐渭","text":"画里樵夫若个图，腰横片斧月痕初。\n不堪斫取真梁栋，只好供薪热茗炉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40232,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为郑先生题画四首值大醉 其四 吹笛者放舟江壁","author":"徐渭","text":"扁舟自分老江湖，秋水长天没野凫。\n长笛一声裂江壁，欲堕不堕觉画图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40233,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送丁肖甫二首 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"鄱阳湖水接天长，君去当秋菡萏芳。\n若使夜来占剑气，不知何处有干将。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40234,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送丁肖甫二首 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"非关策士藏青幕，自是经生在绛帷。\n彭蠡湖中好传雁，滕王阁上合题诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40235,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上谷边词","author":"徐渭","text":"牧场去此苦无多，只隔龙门五尺河。\n野有一川来贡马，铁无半寸反操戈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40236,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋后四日游览摩诃法藏诸刹遇雨书某上人房","author":"徐渭","text":"晴天不及往禅斋，细雨轻尘拂马来。\n笑袒袈沙徐下座，莫须踏湿宝公鞋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40237,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉簪芙蓉 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"玉簪白白芙蓉绯，若个梳妆不学伊。\n青藤道人不解事，一齐涂抹付烟煤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40238,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉簪芙蓉 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"白玉垂簪压地抽，芙蓉占水映塘流。\n若为摘向街头卖，也免梅花换米羞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40239,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石榴梅花 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"姊妹低头内款时，石家妃子骂封姨。\n即今未了炎凉债，许傍梅花写一枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40240,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石榴梅花 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"雊雉青铜惯捣梅，明珠枉自绽红㶟。\n东情醋醋酸如此，只有秦家候吏知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40241,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石榴梅花 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"一涂一抹醉中嬉，一炎一冷偶花枝。\n翟公门巷张罗日，可似今朝画里时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40242,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题富春赵鹿樵所藏香山九老图","author":"徐渭","text":"飞瀑长松画有神，香山高会俨传真。\n于今江上称樵者，他日图中添一人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40243,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题鲤","author":"徐渭","text":"鲤鱼墨中神采多，赤尾银鳞古妇梭。\n二月桃花春水涨，一须万斛上天河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40244,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陶学士烹茶图","author":"徐渭","text":"醒吟醉草不曾閒，人人唤我作张颠。\n安能买景如图画，碧树红花煮月团。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40245,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风鸢图四首 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"天台饶舌骂丰干，何事吟鸢巧弄抟。\n昨夜风馀收堕篾，唤回拾得换寒山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40246,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风鸢图四首 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"鸢长线短欲何之，万丈无由办得斯。\n瞥见游丝天正午，寸搓纸撚钉书时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40247,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风鸢图四首 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"此物等为刍狗草，此飞等是土龙泥。\n东风自古西吹去，不是吹侬合向西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40248,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风鸢图四首 其四","author":"徐渭","text":"冯添鸽籥与膏焚，整队红云过玉真。\n何处邻姬不停织，细听灯火理筝银。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40249,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三涛美人寿为写墨荷应荷汀之索","author":"徐渭","text":"美人为寿小楼中，镜里荷花朵朵红。\n苍鬓不能同白面，玉杯推出紫芙蓉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40250,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题自画菜四种","author":"徐渭","text":"葡菜茐茄满纸生，墨花夺巧自天成。\n若教移向厨房里，大妇为齑小妇羹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40251,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题钱舜举画碧桃","author":"徐渭","text":"片素生烟古色浓，碧桃花树劈春风。\n吹箫仙子今何在，正好骑鸾向此中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40252,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日题自画竹","author":"徐渭","text":"适逢重九又逢公，却苦提壶挂碧空。\n欲写黄花无意兴，乱题湖石数竿风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40253,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宋人画睡犬","author":"徐渭","text":"神妙难寻落笔踪，浑然生质与天同。\n不知酣睡何时觉，料尔都无警盗功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40254,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为陈司理题画","author":"徐渭","text":"葫芦联当海槎攲，海潮如雪拥槎飞。\n萧郎去访支矶事，弄玉楼中怨未归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40255,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋风雨小酌写玉簪复继芭蕉","author":"徐渭","text":"玉簪醉写酒馀春，移与芭蕉绝不真。\n愁绝今宵风雨恶，趁渠留叶与传神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":40256,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]